#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to do common tasks, from install and authentication to checking job status and fetching error messages"
msgstr "Cara melakukan tugas-tugas umum, mulai dari instalasi dan autentikasi hingga memeriksa status job dan mengambil pesan error"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started with Qiskit Functions"
msgstr "Mulai dengan Qiskit Functions"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/functions-get-started.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore Jarman, HIVQE, Cadavid, Chandarana, Leclerc, Sachdeva, HUBO, Filippov, Downfolding, Aharonov, Mundada, Yamauchi, supersymmetric, Paterakis, Gharibyan, Jaffali, Pellow */}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium, Flex, and On-Prem (through the IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users can get started with IBM Qiskit Functions for free, or can procure a license from one of the partners who have contributed a function to the catalog.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna Plan Premium, Flex, dan On-Prem (melalui IBM Quantum Platform API) bisa mulai menggunakan IBM Qiskit Functions secara gratis, atau bisa memperoleh lisensi dari salah satu mitra yang telah berkontribusi fungsi ke katalog.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request a free trial for third-party Qiskit Functions {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-qiskit-functions}"
msgstr "Minta uji coba gratis untuk Qiskit Functions pihak ketiga {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-qiskit-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To request a free trial, navigate to the [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), and explore the details panel. Click `Request a free trial` and fill out information required by the Functions partner, including the IBM Cloud `AccessGroupId`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk meminta uji coba gratis, buka [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), lalu jelajahi panel detail. Klik `Request a free trial` dan isi informasi yang dibutuhkan oleh partner Functions, termasuk `AccessGroupId` IBM Cloud:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to [IBM Cloud IAM](http://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"
msgstr "Buka [IBM Cloud IAM](http://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify eligibility.\n"
msgstr "Verifikasi kelayakan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch your account in the menu bar on the header to one with the following format: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"
msgstr "Ganti akunmu di bilah menu pada header ke akun dengan format berikut: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure the organization is the same as the one associated with your Premium account.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan organisasinya sama dengan yang terkait dengan akun Premium kamu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you see \"[Your Name]'s Account\", you are using your _personal_ account, which is not eligible for premium access.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu melihat \"[Your Name]'s Account\", berarti kamu menggunakan akun _pribadi_ kamu, yang tidak memenuhi syarat untuk akses premium.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access group ID.\n"
msgstr "Temukan ID grup akses kamu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click a group name.\n"
msgstr "Klik nama grup.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Details**.\n"
msgstr "Klik **Details**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Copy the access group ID. It should start with `AccessGroup-`.\n"
msgstr "Salin ID grup akses. ID tersebut harus dimulai dengan `AccessGroup-`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Functions Catalog client {#install-the-qiskit-functions-catalog-client}"
msgstr "Instal klien Qiskit Functions Catalog {#install-the-qiskit-functions-catalog-client}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To start using Qiskit Functions, install the IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog client:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mulai menggunakan Qiskit Functions, instal klien IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve your API key from the [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and activate your Python virtual environment.  See the [installation instructions](/guides/install-qiskit#local) if you do not already have a virtual environment set up.\n"
msgstr "Ambil API key kamu dari [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), lalu aktifkan virtual environment Python kamu.  Lihat [instruksi instalasi](/guides/install-qiskit#local) jika kamu belum menyiapkan virtual environment.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <span id=\"save-account\"></span>**If you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation),** use the `save_account()` method to save your credentials locally. ([Skip to the next step](#functions-untrusted) if you are not using a trusted environment, such as a shared or public computer, to authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform.)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   To use `save_account()`, run `python` in your shell, then enter the following:\n"
msgstr "   Untuk menggunakan `save_account()`, jalankan `python` di shell kamu, lalu masukkan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Type `exit()`. From now on, whenever you need to authenticate to the service, you can load your credentials with the following:\n"
msgstr "   Ketik `exit()`. Mulai sekarang, setiap kali kamu perlu melakukan autentikasi ke layanan, kamu bisa memuat kredensialmu dengan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   For example:\n"
msgstr "   Contohnya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"functions-untrusted\"></span>**Avoid executing code on an untrusted machine or an external cloud Python environment to minimize security risks.** If you must use an untrusted environment (on, for example, a public computer), change your API key after each use by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic. To initialize the service in this situation, use this code:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"**Never include your key in source code, Python scripts, or notebook files.** When sharing code with others, ensure that your API key is not embedded directly within the Python script. Instead, share the script without the key and provide instructions for securely setting it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Lindungi API key kamu\">\n"
"**Jangan pernah menyertakan key kamu di kode sumber, skrip Python, atau file notebook.** Saat membagikan kode dengan orang lain, pastikan API key kamu tidak disematkan langsung di dalam skrip Python. Sebagai gantinya, bagikan skrip tanpa key dan berikan instruksi untuk menyiapkannya secara aman.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you accidentally share your key with someone or include it in version control like Git, immediately revoke your key by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika kamu tidak sengaja membagikan key kamu kepada seseorang atau menyertakannya di version control seperti Git, segera cabut key kamu dengan menghapusnya di halaman [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) untuk mengurangi risiko. Pelajari lebih lanjut di topik [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List the functions you can access {#list-the-functions-you-can-access}"
msgstr "Lihat daftar functions yang bisa kamu akses {#list-the-functions-you-can-access}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you authenticate, you can list the functions from the Qiskit Functions Catalog that you have access to:\n"
msgstr "Setelah melakukan autentikasi, kamu bisa melihat daftar functions dari Qiskit Functions Catalog yang bisa kamu akses:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run enabled functions {#run-enabled-functions}"
msgstr "Jalankan functions yang diaktifkan {#run-enabled-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a catalog object has been instantiated, you can select a function by using `catalog.load(\"<provider/function-name>\")`:\n"
msgstr "Setelah objek catalog dibuat instance-nya, kamu bisa memilih function dengan menggunakan `catalog.load(\"<provider/function-name>\")`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each Qiskit Function has custom inputs, options, and outputs. Check the specific documentation pages for the function you want to run for more information. By default, all users can only run one function job at a time:\n"
msgstr "Setiap Qiskit Function memiliki input, opsi, dan output kustom. Periksa halaman dokumentasi khusus untuk function yang ingin kamu jalankan untuk informasi lebih lanjut. Secara default, semua pengguna hanya bisa menjalankan satu function job dalam satu waktu:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`run()` checks your remaining capacity and backend access before it submits the job. If your instance is out of capacity, or the backend you named is not accessible, `run()` raises an error right away instead of leaving the job to fail in the queue. When capacity is low, `run()` emits a warning. Pass `suppress_low_usage_warning=True` to silence it.\n"
msgstr "`run()` memeriksa sisa kapasitas dan akses backend kamu sebelum mengirimkan job. Jika instance kamu kehabisan kapasitas, atau backend yang kamu tentukan tidak dapat diakses, `run()` langsung memunculkan error alih-alih membiarkan job gagal di antrean. Saat kapasitas rendah, `run()` mengeluarkan peringatan. Berikan `suppress_low_usage_warning=True` untuk mematikannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"check-job-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Periksa status job {#check-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With your Qiskit Function `job_id`, you can check the status of running jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr "Dengan `job_id` Qiskit Function kamu, kamu bisa memeriksa status job yang sedang berjalan. Ini mencakup status berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the Qiskit Function queue. The queue priority is based on how much you've used Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr "**`QUEUED`**: Program remote berada di antrean Qiskit Function. Prioritas antrean didasarkan pada seberapa banyak kamu telah menggunakan Qiskit Functions.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up the remote environment and installing dependencies.\n"
msgstr "**`INITIALIZING`**: Program remote sedang dimulai; ini mencakup menyiapkan environment remote dan menginstal dependensi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. This also includes several more detailed statuses if supported by specific functions.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING`**: Program sedang berjalan. Ini juga mencakup beberapa status yang lebih detail jika didukung oleh function tertentu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**: The function is currently mapping your classical inputs to quantum inputs.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**: Function sedang memetakan input klasik kamu ke input kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**: The function is optimizing for the selected QPU. This could include circuit transpilation, QPU characterization, observable backpropagation, and so forth.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**: Function sedang mengoptimalkan untuk QPU yang dipilih. Ini bisa mencakup transpilasi circuit, karakterisasi QPU, backpropagation observable, dan lain sebagainya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: The function has submitted a job to IBM Quantum Compute Service, and is waiting in the queue.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: Function telah mengirimkan job ke IBM Quantum Compute Service, dan sedang menunggu di antrean.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: The function has an active Quantum Compute job.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: Function memiliki Quantum Compute job yang aktif.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: The function is post-processing results, which can include error mitigation, mapping quantum results to classical, and so forth.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: Function sedang melakukan post-processing hasil, yang bisa mencakup mitigasi error, memetakan hasil kuantum ke klasik, dan lain sebagainya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve result data with `job.result()`.\n"
msgstr "**`DONE`**: Program sudah selesai, dan kamu bisa mengambil data hasil dengan `job.result()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`ERROR`**: The program stopped running because of a problem. Use `job.result()` to get the error message.\n"
msgstr "**`ERROR`**: Program berhenti berjalan karena adanya masalah. Gunakan `job.result()` untuk mendapatkan pesan error.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`CANCELED`**: The program was canceled by a user, the service, or the server.\n"
msgstr "**`CANCELED`**: Program dibatalkan oleh pengguna, layanan, atau server.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"retrieve-results\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve results {#retrieve-results}"
msgstr "Ambil hasil {#retrieve-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.result()` to fetch the result. This output format varies with each function, so be sure to follow the specific documentation:\n"
msgstr "Setelah program `DONE`, kamu bisa menggunakan `job.result()` untuk mengambil hasilnya. Format output ini bervariasi untuk setiap function, jadi pastikan untuk mengikuti dokumentasi khusus:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also cancel a job at any time:\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga bisa membatalkan job kapan saja:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access the associated Quantum Compute jobs {#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs}"
msgstr "Akses Quantum Compute job yang terkait {#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Qiskit Function can submit one or more Quantum Compute jobs to a QPU while it runs. To retrieve the IDs of those runtime jobs, use `job.runtime_jobs()`. You can use these IDs to fetch the runtime job objects from a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance, or to find the workloads on the IBM Quantum&reg; Platform dashboard.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Function bisa mengirimkan satu atau lebih Quantum Compute job ke QPU saat berjalan. Untuk mengambil ID dari runtime job tersebut, gunakan `job.runtime_jobs()`. Kamu bisa menggunakan ID ini untuk mengambil objek runtime job dari instance `QiskitRuntimeService`, atau untuk menemukan workload di dashboard IBM Quantum&reg; Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a function groups its runtime jobs into sessions or batches, use `job.runtime_sessions()` to list the session IDs. Pass one session ID to `job.runtime_jobs()` to return only the runtime jobs in that session:\n"
msgstr "Jika sebuah function mengelompokkan runtime job-nya ke dalam session atau batch, gunakan `job.runtime_sessions()` untuk melihat daftar ID session. Berikan satu ID session ke `job.runtime_jobs()` untuk mengembalikan hanya runtime job dalam session tersebut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The returned list can be empty. A function reports its runtime jobs only when it submits them through the runtime service that the function receives at run time, and some functions do not submit runtime jobs directly.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View job logs {#view-job-logs}"
msgstr "Lihat log job {#view-job-logs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `job.logs()` to retrieve the log output that a function produces while it runs. Logs are useful for tracking progress and for debugging a job that ends in an `ERROR` state.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `job.logs()` untuk mengambil output log yang dihasilkan oleh function saat berjalan. Log berguna untuk melacak progres dan untuk debugging job yang berakhir dalam status `ERROR`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a long-running job that produces many log lines, use `job.filtered_logs()` to return only the lines you want. Pass a regular expression to `include` to keep matching lines, or to `exclude` to drop matching lines:\n"
msgstr "Untuk job yang berjalan lama dan menghasilkan banyak baris log, gunakan `job.filtered_logs()` untuk mengembalikan hanya baris yang kamu inginkan. Berikan ekspresi reguler ke `include` untuk menyimpan baris yang cocok, atau ke `exclude` untuk menghapus baris yang cocok:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List previously run Qiskit Functions jobs {#list-previously-run-qiskit-functions-jobs}"
msgstr "Lihat daftar Qiskit Functions job yang sudah pernah dijalankan {#list-previously-run-qiskit-functions-jobs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to Qiskit Functions:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan `jobs()` untuk melihat daftar semua job yang dikirimkan ke Qiskit Functions:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To narrow the results, pass filters. Filter by function with `function`, by status with `status`, and by submission date with `created_after`. Page through results with `limit` and `offset`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mempersempit hasil, berikan filter. Filter berdasarkan function dengan `function`, berdasarkan status dengan `status`, dan berdasarkan tanggal pengiriman dengan `created_after`. Jelajahi halaman hasil dengan `limit` dan `offset`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you already have the job ID for a certain job, you can retrieve the job with `catalog.job()`:\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu sudah memiliki ID job untuk job tertentu, kamu bisa mengambil job tersebut dengan `catalog.job()`:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch error messages {#fetch-error-messages}"
msgstr "Ambil pesan error {#fetch-error-messages}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a program status is `ERROR`, use `job.error_message()` to fetch the error message as follows:\n"
msgstr "Jika status program adalah `ERROR`, gunakan `job.error_message()` untuk mengambil pesan error sebagai berikut:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Explore circuit functions](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) to build new algorithms and applications, without needing to manage transpilation or error handling.\n"
msgstr "[Jelajahi circuit functions](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) untuk membangun algoritma dan aplikasi baru, tanpa perlu mengelola transpilasi atau penanganan error.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Explore application functions](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver) to solve domain-specific tasks, with classical inputs and outputs.\n"
msgstr "[Jelajahi application functions](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver) untuk menyelesaikan tugas khusus domain, dengan input dan output klasik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) for Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr "Lihat [dokumentasi referensi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) untuk Qiskit Functions.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- For hands-on experience, try out some [tutorials](/tutorials/index#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) that demonstrate Qiskit Functions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Untuk pengalaman langsung, coba beberapa [tutorial](/tutorials/index#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) yang mendemonstrasikan Qiskit Functions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
